starbite: SMBIOS for Windows (Task Manager's CPU name): Star2LteSmbiosDxe (tools/woa/modules-smbios,
copied into Platform/Star2LtePkg/Drivers by build-uefi.sh) builds the table and both entry points itself
(edk2's SmbiosDxe does not fit the release's DXE slot). Built only
with -D STAR2LTE_SMBIOS_DXE (+ STARBITE_SMBIOS_TYPE7=0|1), so builds without it are unchanged.
docs/WIN11-GPU.md section 6.39; image recipe tools/woa/build-win-smbios.sh.

--- a/Platform/Star2LtePkg/Star2LtePkg.dsc
+++ b/Platform/Star2LtePkg/Star2LtePkg.dsc
@@ -394,3 +394,9 @@
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Scsi/ScsiBusDxe/ScsiBusDxe.inf
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Scsi/ScsiDiskDxe/ScsiDiskDxe.inf
+!ifdef STAR2LTE_SMBIOS_DXE
+  Platform/Star2LtePkg/Drivers/Star2LteSmbiosDxe/Star2LteSmbiosDxe.inf {
+    <BuildOptions>
+      *_*_*_CC_FLAGS = -DSTARBITE_SMBIOS_TYPE7=$(STARBITE_SMBIOS_TYPE7)
+  }
+!endif
   MdeModulePkg/Universal/Disk/DiskIoDxe/DiskIoDxe.inf
--- a/Platform/Star2LtePkg/Star2LtePkg.fdf
+++ b/Platform/Star2LtePkg/Star2LtePkg.fdf
@@ -163,3 +163,6 @@
   INF MdeModulePkg/Universal/Disk/UnicodeCollation/EnglishDxe/EnglishDxe.inf
   INF FatPkg/EnhancedFatDxe/Fat.inf
+!ifdef STAR2LTE_SMBIOS_DXE
+  INF Platform/Star2LtePkg/Drivers/Star2LteSmbiosDxe/Star2LteSmbiosDxe.inf
+!endif
